*> The attributes of the attribute command (docs/protocol/18-mob-framework.md §1.3, 17 §1.5; core/src/cmds-entities.cob): the 40 attributes of the registry in id order with
*> the default, the lowest and the highest value, and which entities have each one: AD-LIVING 1 = every living entity (the 26 attributes of LivingEntity.createLivingAttributes),
*> AD-MOB 1 = also a mob (follow_range), AD-PLAYER 1 = also a player (the attributes 17 §1.5 lists for the player). The rest (flying_speed, tempt_range, spawn_reinforcements,
*> waypoint_receive_range) belong to no entity of this core. The names are the registry names without minecraft:.
